				You see a table of rowdy <<people>> playing dice.
				<br>
				<<icon "die.png">><<link [[Shoot Dice|Pub Dice Minigame Intro]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			/* <<else>>
				You see a table of rowdy <<people>> drinking and laughing.
			<</if>> */
