				<<else>>
					<span class="gold">Wren</span> is at the dice table, watching the throws with more interest than <<nnpc_he "Wren">> shows the players.
					<br>
					<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Approach Wren|Pub Gambling Wren]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
