	<br>
<<elseif $lockpickTrainingSet lt 4>>
	You don't have the <<printprice 400000>> to afford the Master Training Set.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $lockpickTrainingSet lt 3 and $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(200000) : 200000)>>
