:: Pub Music Bluff
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

손을 빼고 <<him>>에게 경멸적인 표정을 짓는다.
<br><br>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
<<case "meek">>
	"I'm just trying to give you a tip?" you say. "Please don't treat me like that." You give <<him>> a hurt look.
<<case "shy">>
	"I'm just trying to give you a tip?" you say. "Please don't treat me like that." You give <<him>> a hurt look.
<<case "polite">>
	"I was only trying to give you a tip," you say. "Please don't treat me like that."
<<case "confident">>
	"I was giving you a tip," you say. "You have no reason to accuse me."
<<case "bratty">>
	"팁 주는 사람마다 그렇게 대한다면, 돈을 많이 못 버는 것도 놀랍지 않네." 당신은 <<him>>에게 비웃는다. "내 돈은 내가 갖고 있을게."
<<case "docile">>
	"I'm just trying to give you a tip?" you say softly. "I'm sorry if I upset you."
<<case "flamboyant">>
	"I was only trying to give you a tip," you say. "Please don't treat me like that."
<<case "cruel">>
	"팁 주는 사람마다 그렇게 대한다면, 돈을 많이 못 버는 것도 놀랍지 않네." 당신은 <<him>>에게 비웃는다. "내 돈은 내가 갖고 있을게."
<<default>>
