			<</if>>
		<<case "HBSC Gala">>
			<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
			<<case "meek">>
				"There was a back room. Off the salon. They had cases of pills hidden away from the donors..." You lower your voice. "<span class="lewd">X-Change pills.</span> One of them was an anti pill, kept apart from the rest."
			<<case "shy">>
				"There was a back room. Off the salon. They had cases of pills hidden away from the donors..." You lower your voice. "<span class="lewd">X-Change pills.</span> One of them was an anti pill, kept apart from the rest."
			<<case "polite">>
				"There was a back room off the salon," you say. "They kept cases of pills hidden from the donors. <span class="lewd">X-Change pills.</span> One of them was an anti pill, kept apart from the rest."
			<<case "confident">>
				"You were right about the seams," you say. "There was a sideboard hidden off the main salon. <span class="lewd">X-Change pills,</span> kept separate from the donor display. Including an anti pill the staff handled like it was dangerous."
			<<case "bratty">>
				"Their charity was a front. Off the floor they had whole cases of <span class="lewd">X-Change</span>, anti pills mixed in with the demonstration stock. Their staff didn't want the wrong donor swallowing the wrong colour."
			<<case "docile">>
				"There was a back room. Off the salon. They had cases of pills hidden away from the donors..." You lower your voice. "<span class="lewd">X-Change pills.</span> One of them was an anti pill, kept apart from the rest."
			<<case "flamboyant">>
				"There was a back room off the salon," you say. "They kept cases of pills hidden from the donors. <span class="lewd">X-Change pills.</span> One of them was an anti pill, kept apart from the rest."
			<<case "cruel">>
