			<br><br>

			<<Hes>> silent for a beat. Then <<his>> mouth curves beneath the mask, slow and almost amused.
			<br><br>

			"Just as I expected," <<he>> says, mostly to <<himself>>. "<span class="elk">The owner</span> is..." <<He>> trails off, fingers steepled, gaze somewhere far past the table. Whatever <<he>> was going to finish, <<he>> swallows it.
			<br><br>

			<<He>> looks back at you and shakes <<his>> head once.
			<<if $avery_party?.hbsc?.pillTaken>>
				<<He>> then nods toward the case still tucked somewhere on your person. "Keep the pill... and trust that one day soon, you'll understand <i>why</i> for this whole case."
			<<else>>
				<<He>> then taps the table once. "Next time you find yourself near a case like that, take it if you safely can. <i>It's worth more than coin</i>. Trust me on that, even if I can't tell you the rest."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

			"You did well," <<he>> says, and means it. "Better than I dared hope from a sudden errand."
			<<set $avery_mansion.fox.progress++>>
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $avery_mansion.fox.task to false>>
