			<<case "docile">>
				"It's not a guest, exactly. Avery's taking me to a gala at the bank. The HBSC. It came up suddenly."
			<<case "flamboyant">>
				"There isn't a guest this time," you say. "Avery is taking me to a charity gala at the HBSC. The invitation came without warning."
			<<case "cruel">>
